keywords:
  - networked control
  - sensor scheduling
  - flexible drive
  - rainflow counting
  - stress cycles
  - cyber-physical systems
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, archived results of 936 runs (912 evaluation and 24 calibration),
  per-packet telemetry logs, a 114-check verification suite and analysis scripts for a
  benchmark of stress-weighted telemetry scheduling in three flexible two-inertia servo axes
  sharing a delayed, lossy uplink, evaluated with rainflow-counted stress-cycle severity.
